<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>The <computeroutput><link linkend="_class_bins">Bins</link></computeroutput> class manages various bin modules such as Mailpit, Memcached, Apache, PHP, MySQL, MariaDB, PostgreSQL, Node.js and Xlight. It provides methods to initialize, reload, update, and retrieve these modules. The class also handles logging and service management for the enabled bin modules. </para>
