    <title>getBinByName()</title>
<indexterm><primary>getBinByName</primary><secondary>Bins</secondary></indexterm>
<indexterm><primary>Bins</primary><secondary>getBinByName</secondary></indexterm>
<para><computeroutput>getBinByName (string $name)</computeroutput></para>
<para>Finds a bin by its display name.</para>

<para>Iterates over all bins and returns the one whose getName() matches the provided string. Returns null if no bin matches, so callers can handle unrecognised names without branching on each individual service.</para>

